{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":505000,"name":"NavyWings","username":"NavyWings","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/3be4f8/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-01T19:22:05.334Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI have a Grok bot generating an output I’d like to post to a Vibr group in my Vibr account. In the process to set this up, the bot attempts to open the Vibr QR code login page for me to scan and log in, but the QR code wont generate. Output from Grok is:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\"I’ll open Viber again and see if the sign-in QR code loads this time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eViber is opening now. The screen is still on Housecall Pro, and the QR code isn’t up yet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eViber opened, but the QR code never loaded. It still says no connection, and a retry after a short wait didn’t change anything.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe app can reach the internet for ordinary sites, but the ports Viber needs for sign-in are blocked on this computer, so the code can’t be generated from here.\"\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/5/35baaa4d9e88e7cb8927d0116acd28b2351edf36.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/7FjewXvbnS1cAghQDarlcvA5fCe.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/5/35baaa4d9e88e7cb8927d0116acd28b2351edf36_2_690x431.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7FjewXvbnS1cAghQDarlcvA5fCe\" width=\"690\" height=\"431\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/5/35baaa4d9e88e7cb8927d0116acd28b2351edf36_2_690x431.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/5/35baaa4d9e88e7cb8927d0116acd28b2351edf36_2_1035x646.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/5/35baaa4d9e88e7cb8927d0116acd28b2351edf36.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"8C8B94\"\u003e\u003cdiv class